  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0: Major perf and correctness release. New: GetAsync, generic GetAllByGroup<T>, TryGet. Perf: ConcurrentDictionary + Lazy<T> populate dedup, reflection eliminated from hot paths, cached size estimation. Bug fixes: RefreshLock now stable, persistent sliding expiration actually slides, RemoveGroup is cycle-safe, group bookkeeping leak on eviction fixed, SetDependencies thread-safe and idempotent. Persistent cache: atomic writes, faster cleanup with pre-filter, orphan file cleanup. 100% backward compatible.",
